title: mf path
tags: [[CLI command]] Reconcile
kind: reference
summary: Print the filesystem path of a metarecord (walks the mfr_path chain)

Prints a metarecord's absolute path, or with `--relative` its repository-relative one; exit code 1 without a position ([[Resolving paths]]). It prints the path's exact bytes, for a shell to use (`cd "$(mf path …)"`): a name that is not UTF-8 comes out as the file has it, not as the `%E9` it is shown as ([[Tree names]]).

One daemon call per record: for many, join [[mf repo root]] with one `--resolve-tree mfr_path` read instead.
